  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I propose setting the \"Smoothed\" option as the default for the Stream Camera in VRChat. Currently, the Stream Camera starts with \"Smoothed\" disabled, which can lead users to forget to enable it, resulting in choppy or less fluid camera movements during streaming or recording. Making \"Smoothed\" the default would prevent this oversight, ensuring a smoother output for content creators and streamers right from the start. This change would enhance usability and save users the hassle of manually enabling the setting.",
